  accTitle: Four complementary views of the MISP data model
  accDescr: A teaching map groups events, attributes, objects and Event Reports as structure; tags, taxonomies, galaxies and clusters as context; Analyst Data, sightings and proposals as analysis and feedback; and organizations, distribution and sharing groups as sharing. These are views of the model, not separate databases or containment relationships.
  M["MISP data model<br/>Read these views together"]
  M ---|Structure| S["Events · attributes<br/>Objects · Event Reports"]
  M ---|Context| C["Tags · taxonomies<br/>Galaxies · clusters"]
  M ---|Analysis and feedback| A["Analyst Data<br/>Sightings · proposals"]
  M ---|Sharing| D["Organizations · distribution<br/>Sharing groups"]
